      "title": "New Ported God",
      "anchor": "New_Ported_God",
      "level": 2,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "title": "Xbalanque",
          "anchor": "Xbalanque",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "General"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ranged Basic Attacks"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Damage Type: Physical/Magical"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Scaling Type: Strength & Intelligence Scaling"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Passive: Dead of Night"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deal damage to enemy Gods to gain stacks. Each Strength of Intelligence, whichever is higher."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 1: Branching Bola"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "While active, your basic attacks deal additional damage. When the bola hits a target, it splits and deals reduced damage."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 2: Poison Darts"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fire 15 dart projectiles in a cone, dealing Physical Damage and poisoning enemies hit."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Poisoned enemies repeatedly take Physical Damage and are slowed."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ability 3: Rising Jaguar"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dash in the direction you are currently traveling before rising into the air and becoming CC immune."
                },
                {
                  "text": "While in the air, you fire darts at all nearby enemies, dealing Physical Damage."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Enemies affected by poison darts take additional damage."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ultimate Ability: Darkest of Nights"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Shroud enemy gods in darkness, creating an area they cannot see out of. During this time you have increased basic attack range, basic attack projectile speed, attack speed and movement speed."
                },
                {
                  "text": "If an enemy God leaves the area, they are affected by a decaying slow."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Aspect releasing 26th September!"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aspect of the Night Stalker",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "text": "Branching Bola is no longer a toggle but provides 3 fires of ability based projectiles. Poison darts require less hits to deal full damage. Darkest of Nights loses existing buffs but resets poison darts and provides increased ability damage."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
